# Implicit-eq EO-LiteBullet, N=2^30

Each configuration once; 64 prover threads, one verifier thread.
Hidden component only; input PCS commitment/openings excluded. Setup, generation, initial claim and serialization excluded.
Eq row coefficient generation is included in prover time. Peak RSS is process lifetime VmHWM.
This structured-eq workload differs from the earlier random dense-b workload.

| a bits | Stride | Prover (s) | Proof (KiB) | Verifier (s) | Peak RSS (GiB) | Main allocations (GiB) |
|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 4 | 128 | 1.076025 | 17.9766 | 0.022703 | 0.9950 | 1.0000 |
| 8 | 64 | 1.148412 | 13.0547 | 0.015207 | 1.9892 | 2.0000 |
| 16 | 32 | 2.322210 | 10.6328 | 0.012431 | 3.9896 | 4.0000 |
| 32 | 16 | 3.809437 | 9.4609 | 0.012105 | 7.9850 | 8.0000 |
| 64 | 8 | 7.500978 | 8.9141 | 0.010949 | 15.9887 | 16.0000 |
| 128 | 4 | 15.803701 | 8.6797 | 0.010786 | 31.9932 | 32.0000 |
| full | 2 | 23.671327 | 8.6016 | 0.011000 | 64.0114 | 64.0000 |

Descriptive affine fits over the five 8..128-bit single measurements (not statistical confidence):
prover_seconds = 0.105604086 + 0.121196442 * width; R^2=0.998020; 128/8 ratio=13.7614.
peak_rss_gib = -0.012802442 + 0.250038846 * width; R^2=1.000000; 128/8 ratio=16.0835.

All seven serialized proofs accepted. 42 server correctness cases passed.
Source and binary hashes, machine state, exact commands and all timings follow.

